# Real customer invoice PDFs land here during local testing and via the
# storage service's local-disk mode. Without this file, `COPY src/ ./src/` in
# the Dockerfile bakes whatever is in this folder permanently into the image's
# layer history — not just onto the running container's disk, but into the
# image itself, recoverable from any copy of it (a registry, a `docker save`
# archive, another machine's layer cache) even after the files are deleted.
#
# In production this path is bind-mounted over by docker-compose.yml anyway
# (see the api service's volumes entry), so nothing here is ever needed by the
# built image regardless of environment.
src/uploads/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*.egg-info/

.env
.env.*
